    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a post-apocalyptic landscape covered in snow and ice, you must navigate treacherous conditions, scavenge for resources, and build a camp in the desolate ruins of a gas station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons, set traps, and create safe zones. Managing your supplies is crucial as food and fuel dwindle in the endless winter.</p>",
